cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "immunogenomics-ref: Curated Reference Data for HLA–KIR–ERAP Biological Classifications"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Krantz"
    given-names: "Matthew S"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7589-9127"
repository-code: "https://github.com/krantzlab/immunogenomics-ref"
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-02-20"
keywords:
  - HLA
  - KIR
  - KIR3DL1
  - ERAP1
  - ERAP2
  - NK cell education
  - antigen presentation
  - pharmacogenomics
  - DRESS syndrome
  - immunogenetics
  - reference data
abstract: >-
  Provenance-tracked reference lookup tables for HLA–KIR–ERAP biological
  classifications, derived from the IPD-IMGT/HLA database and peer-reviewed
  literature. Includes HLA-B Bw4/Bw6 and position-80 classifications, HLA-C
  C1/C2 assignments, HLA-B leader peptide (-21M/T) assignments, KIR3DL1 allele
  expression and binding data, and ERAP1/ERAP2 allotype functional classifications.
  All curated entries include confidence tiers, source DOIs, and evidence notes.
